  "why_wrong": "A. Calcium gluconate treats hyperkalaemia, not hypokalaemia. B. Fluids are essential. C. Rapid IV potassium push is dangerous; it must be given diluted and rate-controlled. E. Stopping insulin halts the resolution of ketosis.",
