  "why_wrong": "A. Thyroid storm lacks clonus/hyperreflexia as the hallmark. C. NMS develops over days with rigidity and hyporeflexia, on antipsychotics. D. Anticholinergic toxicity causes dry skin and absent bowel sounds, not clonus. E. Alcohol withdrawal has a different context and signs.",
  "pearl": "Rapid onset + clonus/hyperreflexia after adding a serotonergic drug = serotonin syndrome (NMS = slow + rigidity).",
