  "why_wrong": "B. The PMR diagnosis is not invalidated; GCA is the concern. C. New cranial symptoms in PMR are a red flag, not unrelated. D. Reducing the dose risks an untreated GCA. E. Imaging must not delay sight-saving steroids.",
